# Morning flyers (today + tomorrow @ 9am CT)

Date-keyed finished flyers in `config/morning_flyers.json` are the **main** morning look.
The morning Autopilot post runs at **9:00 AM America/Chicago** and promotes **today’s
full day**, then **tomorrow**. Prefer today’s date-key flyer when today has events;
else tomorrow’s flyer. Flyer date keys match the **event calendar day** on the plate.

## Sacred Ground daily flyer template (Thursday-style)

Gold standard: `assets/sg-morning-flyer-2026-08-06-today-collage.png` (Founder-approved).

Use **versions of this layout system** — not an exact clone every day (stale), and **not** busy collage soup.

| Zone | Content |
|---|---|
| **Header** | `{WEEKDAY} AT` + `Sacred Ground` (gold script) + `Mind • Body • Spirit • Community` |
| **Left** | 1–3 stacked rounded **equal event cards** — icon + title + host + time + short keywords |
| **Right** | Evocative graphics aligned to those cards (clear zones, not overlapping clutter) |
| **Footer** | Circular logo + `shopsacredground.com` + `847-749-3922` + come-as-you-are energy |

## Equal space (hard — Founder Aug 7, 2026)

- Multi-event days: **every event/practitioner gets the same card size and visual weight**
- Pattern: Aug 6 gold-standard stacked equal cards
- **FORBIDDEN:** one hero photo/title + tiny “Also today” / corner badge for a second practitioner
  (Aug 7 FB `sg-morning-flyer-2026-08-07-reflexology.png` — Cheryl huge, Robert squeezed — rejected)
- Aug 7 IG equal-card variant is the correct multi-event energy for that day
- PIL compositor + `build_generation_prompt` must enforce equal cards when 2+ events

## Layout mix (required)

- **~75%** of new/future morning flyers → Thursday-style **equal** card layout (default)
- **~25%** may be artistic single-event hero layouts **ONLY when there is exactly one event**
- Multi-event days → **always** Thursday-style equal cards (never artistic hero)
- `generate-morning-flyers` / `build_generation_prompt` defaults to Thursday-style

## Never put prices on flyers

- **Never** include `$`, dollar amounts, ticket costs, session fees, or “$55 / $99” style prices on morning flyer graphics.
- Do not bake `Event.cost` or TEC cost fields into flyer labels, overlays, or prompts.
- Captions may mention booking links; the **graphic** stays price-free.
- “FREE” for Free Community Meditation / free community events is OK (not a dollar amount).

## Single-image mode (hard — Founder Aug 10, 2026)

- **One excellent primary plate** (`url` / `local`) posts to **both Facebook and Instagram**
- Do **not** generate or require a separate `url_instagram` — dual IG variants are retired (Aug 10 Lisa Maria muddy IG proved weaker variants hurt quality)
- Legacy `url_instagram` is ignored unless an entry explicitly sets `allow_ig_variant: true`
- Pipeline plans the image once and reuses the same media URL on both platforms
- Aug 6 gold standard stays single-URL (do not overwrite)

### Color energy (hard — Founder Aug 10, 2026)

The shared plate must be **colorful, bright, interesting, engaging**:
- Jewel tones + strong contrast (emerald / amethyst / teal / sapphire / amber + gold)
- Lit details like the Aug 6 gold standard (cards, crystals, candles, sacred geometry that glow)
- Generators + selection must **reject** drab / muddy / beige / grey / desaturated purple sludge, empty near-black voids, giant blank cards, thin faint line-art on a dead field
- Aug 10 IG Lisa Maria muddy-purple empty-card plate is the reject example
- Dark elegant backgrounds OK only when bright jewel accents carry the energy
- Code gate: `flyer_passes_visual_energy` (min colorfulness + accent ratio)

## Every day

- Every Chicago calendar day should have a Thursday-style primary flyer (1–3 events max, or a warm visit-day flyer when empty) shared on FB+IG.
- Prebuild: `python3 -m marketing generate-morning-flyers --days 7`
- Morning automation @ 9am: ensure flyer for **today + tomorrow** before publish (see AUTOMATION-DRAFT.md / docs/MORNING-FLYERS.md).
- CLI tip: `generate-morning-flyers --start-offset 0 --days 2` for today+tomorrow.

## Do not

- Do not restore rejected atmospheric `sg-morning-creative-*` plates into rotation
- Do not overwrite a Founder-loved day’s flyer when redesigning other dates
- Do not overwrite the Aug 6 gold standard (`sg-morning-flyer-2026-08-06-today-collage.png`)
- Do not republish Aug 6 just to split FB/IG images
- Do not ship hero + tiny secondary corner badges on multi-event days
